    "created_at": "2024-02-15T12:02:59Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-02-15T12:02:59Z",
    "body": "This [monkey patch](https://github.com/Kaiido/createImageBitmap?tab=readme-ov-file#a-monkey-patch-to-the-htmls-createimagebitmap-method) by @Kaiido implies that \"SVG image in Blob as source\" isn't supported in Chrome yet and this appears to be the case with my own testing.\r\n\r\nAm I misunderstanding things?\r\n\r\nIs this tracked as a bug somewhere? It's been 8 years since this was merged.",
